  "details": "VRChat Version: Build 1032\n\nWhen I joined to a world with capacity 1, after downloading the world, it stucks completely with a black screen.\n\nRepro:\nOK https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_e0474df9-1f58-46d9-803a-e94ef45361c2\nBad https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_5bee0a5f-36eb-4ec2-9430-9382c533f513\ndifference is only a capacity (16 and 1).\n```\n2020.12.18 19:52:01 Log        -  [VRCFlowManagerVRC] Entering world\n\n2020.12.18 19:52:01 Error      -  [API] [145, 400, Get, 2] Request Finished with Error!\nhttps://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/instances/wrld_5bee0a5f-36eb-4ec2-9430-9382c533f513:usr_cc1e1180-c7a0-4c03-ac67-03aa2e11202237890~private(usr_cc1e1180-c7a0-4c03-ac67-03aa2e112022)~nonce(6F209C813A384AF76F0B8116AB5E2C09E9858410E1D2EE2F88F45599462E3D8E)/join?apiKey=JlE5Jldo5Jibnk5O5hTx6XVqsJu4WJ26&organization=vrchat\nNo Exception\n{{\"error\":{{\"message\":\"'usr_cc1e1180-c7a0-4c03-ac67-03aa2e11202237890~private（usr_cc1e1180-c7a0-4c03-ac67-03aa2e112022）~nonce（6F209C813A384AF76F0B8116AB5E2C09E9858410E1D2EE2F88F45599462E3D8E）' is not a valid instanceId\",\"status_code\":400}}}}\n\n2020.12.18 19:52:01 Log        -  [VRCFlowManagerVRC] Waiting for Photon to enter room\n\n```\nIt looks server-side problem.\n\nAttachment: OK world (named \"16\") image / NG world (named \"1\") image after download phase",
